      "Your pack, gear, skills and spellbook are in the panel at the lower right. Doors are open: step inside and look around!",
      "The hens and cattle on Hob's farm are easy practice. Goblin raiders camp to the north-west.",
      "Stronger folk delve the Goblin Caves near their camp... and the bravest, the Crypt beyond the river.",
      "North of Darkwood lies the Bloodmarch. Lawless land: other adventurers may fight you there."
    ],
    "model": "npc_merchant",
    "tint": "#ffe6cc"
  },
